## Integration Notes:
- **Pre-commit hook compatible**
- **CI/CD pipeline ready** 
- **Supports incremental updates**
- **Preserves existing translations**
- **Maintains code formatting**

This rule eliminates manual work and reduces localization time from hours to minutes while ensuring consistency across all language files and proper Flutter localization patterns. 